- StoreContext: remove legacyFallback as catalog source; engine payload is the
  only displayed data; on engine failure use engine cache or empty (no invented
  SKU/stock/brand/age). src/data/products.js stays as archive only.
- productEngine.js: strict payload validation (status==='ok'), passthrough of
  first-class publication fields (workflowStatus/qaStatus/sourceDriveId/
  processedImage/reviewReason).
- gateway functions/api/products.js: validate upstream, fallback to
  /edge-api/products mirror, never return stale/no-status payloads.
- pr-quality.yml: regressions extended (fail-closed + gateway).
